{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"738988904308408340","content":"Copper bows his head in hello to each of them, he replies with a smile, “my apologies Thunderstruck, but I am not the one called Chad. My name is Copper Tin. I am the mayor of this town.“ Copper turns and gestures to Ozgur, “this is my friend Ozgur, he is our builder and one of our strongest warriors.”","created_at":"2020-08-14T18:37:30.183000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-14T18:37:41.926000Z","id":"743901129062219940","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"738988904308408340","content":"He looks back to Thunderstruck and his two daughters, “it is a pleasure to meet each of you. To what do I owe the pleasure?”","created_at":"2020-08-14T18:37:32.265000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-14T18:37:58.113000Z","id":"743901137794629665","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"738988904308408340","content":"\"Mayor? Chief of Chads? Greetings Ozgurchad. We were saved by other Chadkin, and we wanted to come offer our thanks.\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T18:38:48.557000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743901457786339418","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
