{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"738988904308408340","content":"“We arrived on the island not to long ago, from across the ocean to set up a colony here. Once we arrived, many of my people set about preparing for a life here. However things haven’t been exactly simple. From what I understand, many of my people tried being respectful of the inhabitants of the island, yet things didn’t go to well. One of my people got into a fight with one of the inhabitants; a hag I believe it was. Well, they didn’t exactly take to kind to that. From what I understand, they began cursing my town and kidnapping my people. They then assumed the identity’s of my people, and went with us to meet the other inhabitants. While there, they attempted to sabotage our attempts at peace. To a point where tensions where high. Suddenly the island began flooding, which caused the tensions between Chinnokin and the Urucockra rising even more because of this, to a point where war had broken out between them. After my people stopped the flooding is when the war seemed to stop, but not without many lives lost for there tribes. That brings us to this point today. The record keeper can give you a much more detailed account of the recent events, and I may have gotten some things wrong. But I think that information is the most relevant to your questions.”","created_at":"2020-08-14T19:02:48.447000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743907497122725939","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"738988904308408340","content":"While sipping his tea, Ozgur adds \"Also we killed a Bastard Baatezu and saved a Fish God.\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T19:06:33.472000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743908440945983629","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"738988904308408340","content":"\"Hags? This is a time of troubles then. The Chinnokin and Uru have long been allies before we became stone. Much has changed. The Tankans have missed much sorrow in their time as statues. The Hags of the Hanging tree returning may give rise to their former thralls. Beware of Dread wendigo.\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T19:07:02.374000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743908562169757827","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
