{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"738988904308408340","content":"“Our friends here” copper gestures to Thunderstruck and his daughters, “have asked us about the current situation on our island, and the status of the other tribes. I’ve already explained a bit about the hags and the war between the Urucockra and the Chinnokin, do you think either of you could shed more light for them?” He asks ozgur, web, and Baeshra","created_at":"2020-08-14T19:15:42.425000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743910743421747330","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
